              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ icagezwe cayo ngiki: n’uko twizera izina ry’Umwana wayo Yesu Kristo, tugakundana, nk’uko yatubariye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
